1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,840
Listen to a conversation.

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:08,020
Are you still planning to go to the exercise class this evening? Yes, I am.

3
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:11,840
But I realized my old mat is completely worn out

4
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,220
I'll need to pick up a new one before I go.

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:17,680
There's a sporting goods store just a few blocks from the studio.

6
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:20,680
Perfect. I'll stop by on my way.

7
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:22,620
Hopefully they have a decent selection.

8
00:00:23,080 --> 00:00:25,600
Well, if not, the studio has plenty you can borrow

9
00:00:25,960 --> 00:00:27,960
That's what I always do. See you there.
